names bench/tables/elixir/runner.exs 14 plan-read arm pre-clock gate P2 (BENCH-STANDARD.md, the gate before the clock): the plan read's pinned answer, the six VOLD narrowings applied to the 64 identity records by field, as the Rust leg's lineage.rs `expected` does; untimed, no timed loop names a field
